# One author, one line ending. `text=auto` lets git normalise on the way in and
# out; the explicit pins below cover files whose bytes matter more than their
# rendering.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell hooks must keep LF: a CRLF in the shebang line makes a hook unrunnable,
# and on macOS that failure is silent until the hook is needed.
*.sh   text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf

# Generated or binary-ish: never let git rewrite these.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.zst  binary
pnpm-lock.yaml  -diff linguist-generated